@startuml Sequence_S2_01_Manage_Gift_Rule
' US-S2-01 : Admin configure une règle cadeau

title US-S2-01 — Configurer une règle cadeau (admin)

actor "Admin\n(Angular)" as AdminUI
participant "AdminGiftRulesController\n/api/admin/gift-rules" as RulesCtrl
participant "GiftRuleService" as RuleSvc
participant "GiftRepository" as GiftRepo
database "PostgreSQL\n(EF Core)" as DB

AdminUI -> AdminUI : JWT Admin en localStorage\n(Interceptor Bearer)

AdminUI -> RulesCtrl : POST /api/admin/gift-rules\n[JWT Admin]\n{ ruleType, conditionValue,\n  giftId, isActive, priority }
activate RulesCtrl

RulesCtrl -> RuleSvc : CreateAsync(dto)
activate RuleSvc
RuleSvc -> GiftRepo : GetByIdAsync(giftId)
GiftRepo -> DB : SELECT Gift
alt gift introuvable
  RuleSvc --> RulesCtrl : 404
  RulesCtrl --> AdminUI : erreur
else OK
  RuleSvc -> DB : INSERT GiftRule
  RuleSvc --> RulesCtrl : GiftRuleDTO
  RulesCtrl --> AdminUI : 201 Created
end
deactivate RuleSvc
deactivate RulesCtrl

opt Mise à jour / activation
  AdminUI -> RulesCtrl : PUT /api/admin/gift-rules/{id}
  RulesCtrl -> RuleSvc : UpdateAsync(id, dto)
  RuleSvc -> DB : UPDATE GiftRule

  AdminUI -> RulesCtrl : PATCH .../active\n{ isActive: false }
  RulesCtrl -> RuleSvc : SetActiveAsync(id, isActive)
  RuleSvc -> DB : UPDATE IsActive
end

note over AdminUI, DB
  Sprint 2 initial : aussi POST /api/giftrules (public).
  **État actuel** : gestion principale via admin JWT.
end note

@enduml
